<div class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">Open administration inside your app</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Connect the <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-primary" href="{{ site.adminPanel }}">Shellui admin app</a> through <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">backend.adminUrl</code> and set its route with <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">backend.adminPathname</code>. Staff and company owners can then open Administration from the account menu.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">The panel uses your <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-primary" href="{{ site.identityService }}">identity-service</a> backend and the existing Shellui session. Host the admin app yourself or use <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-primary" href="https://admin.shellui.com">admin.shellui.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm">
    {% include "feature-visual-admin.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-10 grid max-w-3xl gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">1. Connect the admin app</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">Set <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">adminPathname</code> and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">adminUrl</code> on a Shellui identity backend.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">2. Sign in as staff or owner</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">The shell makes administration available to staff and company owners. The identity backend checks permissions on administration requests.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">3. Open Administration</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">Open the panel from the account menu. Individual screens have shell URLs such as <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">/admin/users</code>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl">
  {% highlight "json", "shellui.config.json" %}
{
  "backend": {
    "type": "shellui",
    "url": "http://localhost:8000",
    "companyId": 1,
    "adminPathname": "/admin",
    "adminUrl": "http://localhost:5174",
    "login": {
      "methods": ["oauth"],
      "oauthProviders": ["github"]
    }
  }
}
    {% endhighlight %}
</div>

